<title>SINGAPORE: Acer raises investment in Taiwan unit.</title>
<headline>Acer raises investment in Taiwan unit.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acer Computer International Ltd (ACI) said on Friday it had increased its investment in Taiwan subsidiary Acer Global Inc by NT$300 million.</p>
<p>Acer said in a statement it bought 30 million new shares at par for that amount, taking Acer Global's paid up capital to NT$400 million.</p>
<p>Acer Global is a 100 percent subsidiary of ACI, responsible for assembling Acer computers for markets in ACI's territory where there are as yet no local assembly plants.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
